      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start and definitely professional. \n\ni just ran it through the internal scanner and the positivity index came back a bit lower than I was hoping for (like a 0.62). for the training module to really \"pop\" and show the extreme end of our new culture, we ideally need these examples to hit the 0.9+ range. \n\ncould you try another version? try to beef up the positive tone so the score goes up, but please keep it from sounding fake. it still needs to be a response a real lawyer at vanguard would actually send. just aim for a much higher positivity score this time.",
